 "Feeding the networks": "",
 "Each network is added in the terminal: sudo zenithboard menu → 1 ADSB. Their own installers ask questions as they go (a station name, an e-mail, a sharing key) and give a claim link or code to keep: the console runs commands that ask nothing, and keeps no key.": "",
